-action/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/fca-warns-financial-firms-to-control-ai-risks-or-face-action/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:00:53 +0000</pubDate><description>The UK&#x27;s financial regulator has told financial firms they must address cybersecurity risks from the deployment of AI agents, or face regulatory action.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/277/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>WordPress removes six compromised plugins</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/wordpress-removes-six-compromised-plugins/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/wordpress-removes-six-compromised-plugins/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:00:39 +0000</pubDate><description>WordPress removed six compromised plugins before they could be released to the public.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/276/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Fake WordPress plugin hides from admins and bypasses security checks</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/fake-wordpress-plugin-hides-from-admins-and-bypasses-security-checks/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/fake-wordpress-plugin-hides-from-admins-and-bypasses-security-checks/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:59:40 +0000</pubDate><description>A malicious plugin can let attackers access websites without extra security steps and run harmful code on visitors&#x27; devices.</description><media:content url="https://theknowle