roundcube-webmail-updates-fix-12-security-flaws/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:57:41 +0000</pubDate><description>Roundcube has released updates to fix weaknesses in its email software that could expose data or allow unwanted code to run.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/272/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Black Friday 2026: Cybersecurity deals to watch</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/black-friday-2026-cybersecurity-deals-to-watch/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/black-friday-2026-cybersecurity-deals-to-watch/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:57:19 +0000</pubDate><description>Security companies are offering discounts on tools to protect your accounts, so you can save money while boosting your online safety.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/271/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>FIFA confirms hackers accessed personal and business data</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/fifa-confirms-hackers-accessed-personal-and-business-data/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/fifa-confirms-hackers-accessed-personal-and-business-data/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:56:56 +0000</pubDate><description>FIFA has confirmed a data breach, but a hacking group&#x27;s claim that it released 12.2 GB of files is unverified.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/270/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" heigh