safe-online/2026/11/26/ofcom-to-ask-big-online-services-to-publish-safety-reports/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:55:56 +0000</pubDate><description>Ofcom is consulting on rules that will force major social media and search sites to publish annual reports on how they keep users safe.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/267/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Fake wallpaper ads steal emails and social media data</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/fake-wallpaper-ads-steal-emails-and-social-media-data/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/fake-wallpaper-ads-steal-emails-and-social-media-data/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:54:50 +0000</pubDate><description>Fake wallpaper ads are installing software that steals emails and social media details from your computer.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/266/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Passkeys explained: a safer way to log in without passwords</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/passkeys-explained-a-safer-way-to-log-in-without-passwords/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/26/passkeys-explained-a-safer-way-to-log-in-without-passwords/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:54:32 +0000</pubDate><description>Passkeys have the potential to make traditional passwords obsolete, but there is still plenty of uncertainty surrounding them, including how they work and where they are stored.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.gi