line/2026/11/26/many-people-willing-to-pay-to-vanish-from-search-results/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:08:39 +0000</pubDate><description>A US survey suggests many people are willing to pay to remove their personal details from public search results, driven by fears about what artificial intelligence can infer from scattered data.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/225/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Fix for Ghostscript flaw that lets files run commands</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/25/fix-for-ghostscript-flaw-that-lets-files-run-commands/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/25/fix-for-ghostscript-flaw-that-lets-files-run-commands/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:07:48 +0000</pubDate><description>A security fix is available for a flaw in Ghostscript that could let malicious files run commands on servers.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/215/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Windows update may stop printing for some business users</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/25/windows-update-may-stop-printing-for-some-business-users/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/25/windows-update-may-stop-printing-for-some-business-users/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:07:33 +0000</pubDate><description>Microsoft says a recent update can cause printing errors on some Windows 11 computers, but a fix is not yet available.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/214/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item></channel></rss>
